SUMMARY:[Data Mining & Data Science][Machine Learning] WSDM 2027 - Abstract
  submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM International Conference on Web Search an
 d Data Mining\nWebsite: https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/\nSource URL
 : https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nLocation: Hong Kong\, C
 hina\nTopics: Data Mining & Data Science\, Machine Learning\, Fairness & 
 Responsible AI\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nSize: L\nSubmission t
 ype: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-30\nN
 otes: Official WSDM 2027 pages (rechecked 2026-10-30) list Hong Kong (Cor
 dis)\, Feb 15-19\, and AoE deadlines: full-paper abstract Aug 17 and pape
 r Aug 24\, 2026 (closed\; notification Nov 2)\, short papers (up to 4 pag
 es\, new work) Nov 17\, doctoral consortium (single-author student packet
 ) Nov 12\, and WSDM Day presentations Nov 30\, 2026 (2-page extended abst
 ract on search\, data mining and agentic AI\; unpublished or under-review
  work welcome\; oral or poster on Feb 19\, in the proceedings). Demo pape
 rs closed Oct 15\, 2026. Industry Day talk proposals (2 pages with speake
 r bio\, due Oct 30) are not tracked as a paper route.\nScope: Web search\
 , ranking\, recommendation and mining of web and social data. Characteris
 tic extensions include large-scale graph analysis\, conversational retrie
 val\, foundation-model and agentic web systems\, and fairness and privacy
  in information access. The broad emerging-applications inventory is not 
 treated as evidence that WSDM is a specialist healthcare or climate venue
 .\nAdditional topics: Information Retrieval & Search\, Recommender System
 s\, Graphs & Graph Learning\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\, Natural Language Pr
 ocessing & LLMs\nScope sources (2027): https://www.wsdm-conference.org/20
 27/cffp.html\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html
END:VEVENT
